abstract: Fourteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning foundational mechanisms and modern extensions. v1.5.1 hardens learner interaction and adoption without changing applet algorithms: complete privacy-minimized GoatCounter coverage with canonical page and event semantics, targeted KNN/Bayesian/Neural responsive fixes, a learner-centered state/recovery QA contract, and two ready-to-assign student Activity Pack canaries derived from classroom use.
